OL,3,GNEWSAFranz Ferdinand turning to art at
OL,4,AGlasgow Print Studio
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was the neighbourhood that launched
OL,7,FFranz Ferdinand's career and even got a
OL,8,Fmention in one of their earliest songs.
OL,10,F"Well here we are at the Transmission
OL,11,Fparty. I love your friends they're all
OL,12,Fso arty," is the line in their single
OL,13,FDo You Want To.
OL,15,FTwenty-one years later, the band are
OL,16,Fback in the Glasgow Print Studio - two
OL,17,Fdoors down from Transmission Gallery -
OL,18,Fto launch a limited edition print that
OL,19,Fcelebrates their musical journey and
OL,20,Ftheir Scottish roots.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
