OL,3,GNEWSAFranz Ferdinand turning to art at
OL,4,AGlasgow Print Studio
OL,5,
OL,6,FBassist Bob Hardy said: "When I was a
OL,7,Fstudent and we were getting the band
OL,8,Ftogether, it was often the openings
OL,9,Fthat would take place on King Street
OL,10,Fwhich would be the beginning of a night
OL,11,Fout.
